From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Stoffel <stoffel.thomas.ryan@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 05:49:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] workbench: delete the unused startup helpers

The methods that built the sidebar, activity bar, panel, title bar,
editor, and sessions surface were left in the class after startup
stopped calling them. Typecheck reports them as unused, so they are
removed.

Issue #316.

